[{"title":"题唐子华画山水","author":"自恢","text":"江云如雪树高低，竹里人家傍水西。\n满地松阴春雨过，好山青似若耶溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":225,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶成","author":"自恢","text":"金沙溪上柳条齐，白鸟群飞落照低。\n十里荷花红胜锦，好山都在画桥西。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":226,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张贞居游仙诗 其一","author":"释净圭","text":"缥缈仙山五色云，玉真飞佩度氤氲。\n不应名字题仙籍，犹著唐家旧赐裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":227,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和张贞居游仙诗 其二","author":"释净圭","text":"一会仙凡两地分，双双绦脱赐羊君。\n如何窈窕巫山女，只作襄王梦里云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":228,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"赠北磴和尚","author":"怀海","text":"橘州骨冷不容呼，正始遗音扫地无。\n一代文章归北涧，十年梵语落西湖。\n人皆去献辽东豕，我独来看屋上乌。\n春尽闭门无恙否，杨花飞作雪模糊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":229,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄梅雪朱隐居","author":"净慧","text":"何处风篁好，渔庄路匪遥。\n水光清暑簟，花影赤阑桥。\n座客分诗卷，邻姬浣酒瓢。\n离怀无可赠，清梦过兰苕。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":230,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题天马图","author":"净慧","text":"八尺飞龙十二闲，飘飘来自岢岚山。\n曾陪八骏昆仑顶，肯逐群雄草莽间。\n落日倒行悲峻阪，西风苦战忆重关。\n拂郎可是无新贡，天步于今政险艰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":231,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"深秀亭暮春述怀","author":"志琼","text":"空庭雨湿聚华茵，回首东风忆远人。\n玉砌香消行迹断，雕阑吟彻别愁新。\n楼台半是前朝景，桃李都承旧日春。\n归燕多情还恋主，衔泥双拂画梁尘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":232,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"关山月","author":"仁淑","text":"白杨风萧萧，胡笳楼上发。\n壮士不知还，羞对关山月。\n去年天山归，皎皎照白骨。\n今年交河戍，明明凋华发。\n交河水东流，征战无时歇。\n斗酒皆楚歌，歌罢泪成血。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":233,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"周玄初祷雨诗","author":"观白","text":"仙姿寒湛玉壶冰，斩叱群魔走百灵。\n万里风云生赤日，九天雷电下青冥。\n瑶坛鹤唳秋如水，蕙帐人幽月满庭。\n安得相从过衡岳，飞行同蹑凤凰翎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":234,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"咏苔","author":"正淳","text":"青如蚨血染颓垣，汉寝唐陵几断魂。\n莫笑贫家春寂寞，渐随积雨上青门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":235,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"次韵秋怀","author":"文谦","text":"命晋昔闻千矢赐，拜韩今见一军惊。\n地连赤县城中阻，水入黄河总未清。\n几茎素发殊方病，半幅乡书故国情。\n洛下伤时同贾谊，西都卖卜似君平。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":236,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江行倡和诗","author":"善启","text":"遥汉华月升，孤墅暝烟合。\n桅樯影倒垂，柔橹声互答。\n宵霁谩贪程，春寒犹恋衲。\n鸣空雁几行，绕树乌三匝。\n邮驰递去铃，渔挈沽来榼。\n停榜次群艘，听歌吴楚杂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":237,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"十五日桃红复含宿雨柳绿更带朝烟","author":"善启","text":"篷底远山叠叠，船头新水滔滔。\n烟暖已舒岸柳，春寒未放溪桃。\n浮世空嗟扰扰，逝川莫驻滔滔。\n且从远老栽藕，肯学刘郎种桃。\n独树村边落照，短篷江上回风。\n沙草微含烟碧，溪花半带雨红。\n吟处有山有水，归程无雨无风。\n何须竹叶浮绿，自喜灯花吐红。\n夜泊歌邀明月，晓行帆送东风。\n峨峨山殿衔碧，隐隐驿楼露红。\n客路柳条拂露，官河荇带牵风。\n渔艇横浮萍绿，酒旗斜映桃红。\n风岸青摇弱蔓，露汀绿蔼芳条。\n赋诗已盈一箧，客路才远数朝。\n人家竹里树里，客路山边水边。\n夜榜桅头挂月，晨炊船尾生烟。\n钟动锡山驿外，帆收浒墅桥边。\n两岸晓风残月，几家古木寒烟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":238,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄演福和尚","author":"大冂","text":"雨红烟绿暮春时，独客终朝有所思。\n白水漾沙金错落，青山浮几玉参差。\n一帘花妥莺啼缓，千里书成鹤去迟。\n后夜更看湖上月，满怀愁绪散如丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":239,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"感事","author":"明秀","text":"啄乌搏鸡雏，翼翼鸡母护。\n孤儿悲茕独，颜色失其怙。\n黑风雨益暗，同过前溪渡。\n茫茫春水深，骨肉不相顾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":240,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀太白山人","author":"明秀","text":"阶前黄叶堆欲满，湖上白云閒自来。\n千里秋风悲断雁，两峰寒日忆登台。\n未能明月同移棹，想见黄花独举杯。\n吟遍长松千万树，南屏落日寺门开。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":241,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山中怀萝石翁","author":"明秀","text":"老怀常耿耿，岁暮一行书。\n寒日孤城短，山堂独夜虚。\n病多忧到骨，吟苦泪盈裾。\n只恐梅花笑，相逢齿发疏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":242,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"晓长老挽词","author":"明秀","text":"西池花谢见莲成，短世逢人问死生。\n白发卧云真是病，青山埋骨始完名。\n雨灯夜著虚堂影，秋磬寒随落木声。\n欲为吾师著禅行，石章兼勒嗜茶铭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":243,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"碧空先辈挽诗","author":"明秀","text":"独听钟声坐夜阑，袈裟何处问丰干。\n浮云忽灭心灯在，一树梅花月影寒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":244,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"漫兴","author":"明秀","text":"落日千峰拄杖前，古苔长拟隐居篇。\n颍滨定有箕山月，庐岳时看瀑布泉。\n小阁梅花迎老眼，残书白发卧高天。\n圣朝有道忧今少，药饵烟霞且岁年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":245,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄九杞先生","author":"明秀","text":"两句三年报已成，杞泉凉月照人清。\n九华芝草高踪在，千里冥鸿病眼明。\n野墅柴门香稻熟，渔村江树晚山晴。\n凭谁唤起王摩诘，画汝纶巾杜曲行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":246,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"许泉亭秋日","author":"明秀","text":"手把传灯录，西岩卧病翁。\n柴关上野色，石壁下秋风。\n岁月飞鸿外，江山落叶中。\n菊花知九日，青蕊更丛丛。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":247,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"明秀","text":"人坐秋树下，月在秋树上。\n苦吟落叶空，瘦影自相向。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":248,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"得白泉徐侯书","author":"明秀","text":"槜李城西从拂袖，归帆直过钓台西。\n却怜别后无消息，忽得书来问杖藜。\n江岸鹧鸪悲暮雨，柴门燕子惜春泥。\n海边犹有甘棠树，几向花阴忆贵溪。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":249,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泛舟至桐口","author":"明秀","text":"路转青村合，山连赤岸斜。\n夕阳飞燕子，茅屋落桐花。\n晚墅闻孤笛，轻舟阁浅沙。\n前峰望不远，林暝欲栖鸦。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":250,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题墨山扇图","author":"明秀","text":"远屿孤烟起，林亭落日虚。\n青山半江影，竹里照残书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":251,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宾山驻锡云居","author":"明秀","text":"满地云山皆幻住，此心若了始为僧。\n草茅径昃须扶杖，雾雨堂昏要续灯。\n警露鹤鸣穿壁月，弄花猿引挂岩藤。\n闭门细究《楞严》旨，镜像年芳未可凭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":252,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宿归云堂","author":"明秀","text":"寺前昨日雨，水满放生池。\n独往忽乘兴，幽寻岂有期。\n夜深月未出，秋近竹先知。\n重把茶杯坐，云山话所思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":253,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读谢翱传","author":"明秀","text":"南奔北走家何在，七里滩前许剑来。\n厓海夜寒惟月上，冬青树老又花开。\n侧身天地聊晞发，怅望江山独把杯。\n一掬当年知己泪，秋风洒尽下西台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":254,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨夜","author":"明秀","text":"灯影西堂里，三年病惠休。\n空山闻夜雨，独客抱春愁。\n花鸟寒应苦，星河暗自流。\n谁家有明月，长笛倚高楼？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":255,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋兴","author":"明秀","text":"木落关山岁暮时，风云万里忆京师。\n著书独惜虞卿老，怀古犹含庾信悲。\n海郭清砧寒近捣，山楼短笛夜深吹。\n江南秋水平如镜，只恐无人照鬓丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":256,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"庚辰岁感事次吴宿威太守韵","author":"明秀","text":"消息真传愁暮春，行营旧国动星辰。\n徒怜汉武巡游地，不见周王清路尘。\n别殿蓬莱花事静，芳洲鹦鹉客愁新。\n秦淮一带芜城月，翠辇琵琶载美人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":257,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"烟霞寺一百七岁老僧","author":"明秀","text":"垂老犹疑宝掌翁，一龛枯坐万山中。\n闭门不管春来去，芳草满阶栖落红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":258,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宜晚社西野席上","author":"明秀","text":"迟暮山林意颇同，一尊且共话年丰。\n租佣不堕常时业，铅椠兼收卒岁功。\n秋水衣巾明野色，朔云杞菊倚寒丛。\n论兵策马俱难用，只作江南白发翁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":259,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋日登栖云岭","author":"明秀","text":"黄落山川入望遥，行过云岭忆前朝。\n秋风废苑悲丛棘，明月珠帘想玉箫。\n岛屿晴浮渔树浦，江潮寒上海鲜桥。\n迢迢西崦斜阳路，惟见归鸦趁暮樵。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":260,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻顾子重过五亩山自杭归款叙数日","author":"明秀","text":"桐花吹雨惜残春，满地江湖见隐沦。\n短笠轻舟终远去，白云春草唤愁新。\n画牛事已知弘景，学稼心常忆子真。\n山月一樽谈未了，夜深犹照病闲人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":261,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过孙山人故居 其二","author":"明秀","text":"歌残桂树小山空，野鹤孤栖自一丛。\n万里中原归不得，空馀长剑卧秋风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":262,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚江秋晓次石田翁韵 其一","author":"明秀","text":"睡起长年报水程，江花无数傍船明。\n汉阳人语舟横渡，夏口鸡鸣月近城。\n寂寞阵图诸葛计，支离心事杜鹃行。\n却从岁序悲黄叶，一夜湘潭白发生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":263,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚江秋晓次石田翁韵 其二","author":"明秀","text":"草寒霜渚梦悠悠，衡岳西风落木秋。\n病里断猿司马泪，吟馀残月仲宣楼。\n自怜江汉犹迟暮，谁采城蓉寄远游。\n鸿雁一行斜不度，水光山色满汀洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":264,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"楚江秋晓次石田翁韵 其三","author":"明秀","text":"山川摇落露华晞，野寺鸣钟破曙晖。\n千里人烟江郭静，数声渔笛水禽飞。\n寒催刀尺风霜早，日远关河信息稀。\n丛菊又开身在客，长沙谁念未成衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":265,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟还 其一","author":"明秀","text":"东家西家看竹，南寺北寺题诗。\n欲问出门高兴，山中猿鹤幽期。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":266,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟还 其二","author":"明秀","text":"晚笔青山剩语，春沙白鹭馀杯。\n两岸落花芳草，满船明月归来。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":267,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方洲张公二姬双节 其一","author":"明秀","text":"交剪云鬟为主恩，镜台花落洗头盆。\n同心待死芳洲上，霜月寥寥夜到门。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":268,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"方洲张公二姬双节 其二","author":"明秀","text":"缟素沈沈抱所天，死心已在剪刀前。\n主家楼上孤灯泪，同洒秋风四十年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":269,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"平望道中","author":"明秀","text":"两岸青山日半衔，洞庭天水碧相涵。\n东风正报桃花信，湖面归渔网作帆。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":270,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"临终诗","author":"明秀","text":"一夜小床前，灯花雨中结。\n我欲照浮生，一笑浮生灭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":271,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"自诫","author":"普泰","text":"眼将䀫就枕，肠觉饥即食。\n物我陈两间，化毋均埏埴。\n人唯草一茎，随时恣生息。\n百年苦无多，矻矻劳心力。\n龙驹毙良材，翡翠伤羽翼。\n贤哉塞上翁，心不计得失。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":272,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春有冬","author":"普泰","text":"于年春有冬，于日朝有夕。\n漂泊旅亭人，忽尔归来客。\n堂堂七尺躯，明明梦窟宅。\n青史数行字，荒丘一片石。\n人间竟无赖，地下终何益。\n但图此生容，入穴免逼迫。\n若知养心术，无欲乃良策。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":273,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"怀南山旧居","author":"普泰","text":"我本山中人，却来城市住。\n一违猿鹤盟，幽思于谁诉。\n茅舍锁烟霞，苍苔兹石路。\n欲归归未得，花落春光暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":274,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"过牛头寺","author":"普泰","text":"行过多歧又问歧，云林深处到来迟。\n寺僧相见不相语，自对斜阳读断碑。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":275,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悼竹岩处士","author":"普泰","text":"竹阴山色郁葱葱，厌俗编茅向此中。\n花谢水流人不返，蛛丝空罥半窗风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":276,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄杨君谦二首 其一","author":"普泰","text":"都下闻归雁，江东忆故人。\n高山千里梦，芳草十年春。\n吟苦先催老，心安却耐贫。\n吴门他日过，书院许谁邻。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":277,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄杨君谦二首 其二","author":"普泰","text":"吏隐千年远，南峰事竟同。\n鉴容依石水，熏佩度花风。\n林霭床头湿，崖泉厨下通。\n纷纷尘世念，不入此山中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":278,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"足献吉秋风南北路相别寺门前之句","author":"普泰","text":"身世本如寄，去留俱洒然。\n秋风南北路，相别寺门前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":279,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"韩亚卿德夫去官还陕","author":"普泰","text":"秋日泊沙湾，君行早晚还。\n分违无限意，流水不相关。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":280,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄广川准无则","author":"普泰","text":"白云红树对离情，秋意微茫画不成。\n吟就新诗书落叶，凭风吹过德州城。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":281,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"茶盆山先师灵塔","author":"普泰","text":"一出烟霞失所依，重来生死路相违。\n猊床尚设笼蛛网，风度柴门叶乱飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":282,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"牡丹","author":"普泰","text":"十年不见此花开，宝地芬芳我独来。\n坐赏东风诗未就，钟声催上说经台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":283,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寓南高峰怀友","author":"文湛","text":"庵住南峰下，四檐松竹青。\n月常陪入定，猿或听谈经。\n池近凉生榻，山高影落庭。\n故人在何处，诗酒醉兰亭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":284,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春尽","author":"文湛","text":"斜阳穿树林，野屋临溪水。\n春尽不开门，花落空山里。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":285,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题月堂精舍","author":"文湛","text":"雨后青苔路不分，柴门竹里映斜曛。\n松花落尽无人到，只有山童扫白云。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":286,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"西湖杂咏","author":"文湛","text":"宋家宫阙已萧萧，满目残阳照野蒿。\n独有两峰青不了，至今南北插云高。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":287,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绿杨紫燕图","author":"文湛","text":"紫燕双双掠水滨，绿杨袅袅不胜春。\n朱门华屋知多少，认得谁家是主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":288,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题画芙蓉","author":"文湛","text":"江边谁种水芙蓉，寂寞芳姿照水红。\n莫怪秋来更多怨，年年不得见春风。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":289,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"渔妇词","author":"文湛","text":"阿侬住在太湖边，出没烟波二十年。\n不愿郎身做官去，愿郎撒网妾摇船。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":290,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"松阴小憩","author":"净伦","text":"风来石上松，僧坐松下石。\n洗钵将煮茶，溪流漾晴碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":291,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"斗室","author":"怀让","text":"幽轩构得宽于斗，车马红尘不许通。\n柱底祗能藏酒瓮，壁间聊足挂诗筒。\n雨声到枕巡檐响，花影横窗满榻红。\n莫笑贫居苦蜗窄，乾坤都在一壶中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":292,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"广陵道中夜行有怀故园诸友","author":"德珉","text":"潮落空江月满洲，夜凉沙际淡萤流。\n人家远近迷烟树，灯火微茫映客舟。\n露下蒹葭欹岸夕，风惊络纬野篱秋。\n天涯聚散相知少，惆怅蓬窗忆旧游。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":293,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友桂史隐君挽诗","author":"宗圆","text":"茅茨不剪小亭幽，白芷红兰已自秋。\n斜日一溪杨柳静，水禽飞上钓鱼舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":294,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"友桂史隐君挽诗","author":"宝明","text":"东林烟月旧松萝，无复君来对酒歌。\n千个芭蕉万竿竹，相思一夜雨声多。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":295,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]